{
  "$comment": "Blender-built decor (tools/art/blender/families/decor.py): wall art and clocks, ornaments, curtains and rugs. Replaces the primitive-part placeholders by key; listed in the base manifest's packs. The placeholder is kept as a fallback if a file fails to load, and the materials map onto the game's finishes so a model costs one draw call per finish group. The wall clock's second hand and the grandfather clock's pendulum go round near the camera (`idle`); the clock's door opens to wind it, the hanging plant sways when watered, the fire burns while a resident warms up by it, and the curtains are drawn at night.",
